# QCEW 2023-2025
## CKAN Data API
### Use the API in code
#### JavaScript (JSONP)
```  
var data = { resource_id: '119eef38-3b59-499f-8f7c-9bea4768469d', limit: 5, q: 'jones' };  
$.ajax({  
  url: 'https://publish.data.ca.gov/api/3/action/datastore_search',  
  data: data,  
  dataType: 'jsonp',  
  success: function (response) {  
    console.log(response.result.total, response.result.records);  
  }  
});  
```

